      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nDerelict cottage with outbuildings situated on a large C. 3 acre site located in a rural setting in Moylough approximately 4km from Tubbercurry town.Accommodation comprises of front & back porch, sitting room, kitchen & two bedrooms.Situated to the side & rear of the cottage are three old farm buildings, a walled pen with a cattle crush & an old hay barn.The large C. 3 acre site could be easily split into paddock fields ideal for someone wanting a small holding for a few animals or organic gardening.Located in a quiet rural setting in the heart of an area of outstanding natural beauty only 4km approx. from Tubbercurry town in south Co. Sligo. It is within easy access to the N17 Sligo / Galway road and only approx. 15km from Knock airport.Viewing is highly recommended to really appreciate the potential this charming old cottage has to offer."
      },
